      "sourceTextSha256": "12cb66e2b7a22881c3d3f128cf78af1b6fdf3fa72f09bcad9417449cbdfd4802",
      "text": "Day 13 · Breakfast, then a full day (10 hours) in Tayrona National Natural Park, 45 minutes from Santa Marta, a sanctuary of remarkable biodiversity, beaches and indigenous cultures. From the Cañaveral sector, walk about an hour along the ecological trail to Arrecifes, then about 30 minutes more to the beaches of Cabo San Juan del Guía: free time to swim, typical lunch, and return on foot along the same path.",
